            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Spiritu yaYehova enza nikwinza hadi Yefwata, yohita nimuGileyadi nimuManase, yohita nimuMizipa wakuGileyadi, yofuma kuMizipa wakuGileyadi yohita nikwadiŋuwu anyana kaAmoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yefwata hakudishiila mukumesu aYehova, nindi, Neyi chalala wukunyinka anyana kaAmoni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ninami, chinakenza cheŋi kudi anyana kaAmoni kunukuya, kwamwena dehi, chochuma chakedika muyisu yami nakunkinkilila chakela chambala chaYehova, nakachilambula hihimulambu wakushita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nochu Yefwatawahitili nakuya kwadiŋuwu anyana kaAmoni, akalwi nawu; Yehova wamwinkeluwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yofumisha nikuArowenai nichiwukushika kuMinitina kuyitapa hohu, nyikala makumi ayedi kwaamu, nikukachana kekalakumatempa anyivinyu, kuketwila dakujilumuna. Nochu anyana kaAmoni ayifwomokeleli anyana kaIsarela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yefwata wafuntili kwitala dindi kuMizipa nindi atali, mwanindi wamumbanda iwu wukwidika nakumukinkilila iwu, nandimba nakuhaŋana; wadiŋi mwanindi wumu hohu, hadiŋi namwanindi mukwawu helaweyala hela wamumbandaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chamumweniyi, watabwili mahinindi, nindi, Yayo, eyi mwanami! Wunambayishi dehi kweyi, wunekali dehi mukwakunkabisha, muloŋa Yehova namwasamina dehi mukanwa kami, hinukutwesha kubalumuna mwokuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yena wamwilili nindi, Eyi tatayami, wunamwasamini Yehova mukanwa keyi, ŋili mwejima munafumi mukanwa keyi, nanochu chanakutendiyi Yehova hadi ayilumbu jeyi, wowuanyana kaAmoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wamwilili tata yindi nindi, Aŋili chumichi; anlekikwami tukweji tuyedi niyi nakwendola hamapidi nakudila wujiki wami, ninami niakwetu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wamwilili nindi, Yaŋa. Wamutemesheli nindi yaŋa atukweji ayedi. Nochu wayili niyena ni akwawu nakudila wujiki windihamapidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cheliluwu atukweji ayedi anamani dehi, hakufunta kuditata yindi, hakumwila mwomwadishiililiyi; hadilukili kwindi neyalaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chelili chila muIsarela, anyana awambanda aIsarela hiyakuya hamwakaha mwaka nakumudila mwana kaYefwata wakuGileyadi mafuku awanahamwaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
